  (text "3. HOT-SIDE 3.3 V SUPPLY (KP3310SGA)" (at 21.5900 198.1200 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 6d0c87ae-89a9-4500-a0af-86bcce2a6321))
  (text "Half-wave from N_F; KP3310 charges VDD (7.8 V) while the line is low, then an LDO makes 3.3 V. SEL open =\n3.3 V.\nHold-up: 15 mA (worst case) x 20 ms / 220 uF = 1.4 V droop on VDD (7.8 V to 6.4 V), so VOUT stays in\nregulation." (at 21.5900 201.9300 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 78458131-dbf3-4a54-9542-acd9809e5501))
