  (text "5. POLARITY AND EARTH CHECK" (at 142.2400 175.2600 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 77e63002-3e3c-4512-823a-4554248fd80f))
  (text "Arm A: E -> 2 x 2M (HV) -> sense 20k -> L_BUS.  Arm B: E -> 2 x 2M (HV) + 20k -> N_F, so a missing earth floats to mid-supply.\nPeak detector BAT54WS + 1u // 1M (tau 1 s); thresholds 1.02 V (bit A) and 0.31 V (bit B) from a 220k/68k/30k ladder.\nCorrect: A=1 B=1.  Swapped L/N: A=0 B=0.  No earth: A=0 B=1.  Each arm must withstand a 6 kV impulse: VR37-class HV resistors." (at 142.2400 179.0700 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid c31bbd5e-342f-42f9-b2e1-1549b0aedc73))
